\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://sophia.agencyos.network/og-image.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Sophia AI Factory\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Sophia AI Factory\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Build, deploy, and scale AI-powered applications with confidence\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://sophia.agencyos.network/og-image.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"antialiased\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><section class=\"relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-surface via-surface-container-low to-surface-container-highest\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-20 text-center\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><span class=\"inline-block px-4 py-1.5 mb-6 text-sm font-medium bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container rounded-full\">For Digital Agencies</span><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6 tracking-tight\">Sophia AI Factory</h1><p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-on-surface-variant mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">AI-powered proposal generator for agencies. Close more deals, faster. Target: $1M ARR.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-medium rounded-full transition-colors bg-primary text-on-primary hover:bg-primary-hover px-8 py-4 text-lg h-14\">Start Free Trial</button><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-medium rounded-full transition-colors border-2 border-outline text-primary hover:bg-primary/10 px-8 py-4 text-lg h-14\">Watch Demo</button></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 bg-surface\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4 tracking-tight\">Why Sophia?</h2><p class=\"text-xl text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">Everything you need to build production-ready AI applications</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-5xl text-primary mb-4 block\">flash_on</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-on-surface mb-2 tracking-tight\">Lightning Fast</h3><p class=\"text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed\">Optimized performance with edge deployment and automatic code splitting.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-5xl text-primary mb-4 block\">shield</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-on-surface mb-2 tracking-tight\">Secure by Default</h3><p class=\"text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed\">Enterprise-grade security with built-in authentication and authorization.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-5xl text-primary mb-4 block\">auto_awesome</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-on-surface mb-2 tracking-tight\">AI-Powered</h3><p class=\"text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed\">Intelligent automation for repetitive tasks and smart decision-making.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-5xl text-primary mb-4 block\">trending_up</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-on-surface mb-2 tracking-tight\">Scalable Growth</h3><p class=\"text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed\">Built to scale from startup to enterprise with zero infrastructure worries.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 bg-surface-container-low\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4 tracking-tight\">AI Proposal Generator</h2><p class=\"text-xl text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">Create winning proposals faster with AI assistance</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-5xl text-primary mb-4 block\">edit_note</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-on-surface mb-2 tracking-tight\">Automated Proposal Writing</h3><p class=\"text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed\">Generate professional proposals in minutes with AI-powered content creation tailored to your client&#x27;s needs.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-5xl text-primary mb-4 block\">psychology</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-on-surface mb-2 tracking-tight\">AI-Powered Insights</h3><p class=\"text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed\">Get intelligent recommendations on pricing, positioning, and strategy based on market data and win rates.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-5xl text-primary mb-4 block\">description</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-on-surface mb-2 tracking-tight\">Custom Templates</h3><p class=\"text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed\">Choose from industry-specific templates or create your own branded templates for consistent proposals.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 bg-surface-container-highest\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4 tracking-tight\">Simple, Transparent Pricing</h2><p class=\"text-xl text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">Choose the plan that fits your needs</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"relative p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface text-on-surface \"><div class=\"text-center mb-6\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2 tracking-tight\">Starter</h3><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-center gap-1 mb-2\"><span class=\"text-4xl font-bold\">$49</span><span class=\"text-on-surface-variant\">/month</span></div><p class=\"text-on-surface-variant\">Perfect for side projects and small startups</p></div><ul class=\"space-y-4 mb-8\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-primary\">check_circle</span><span class=\"text-on-surface\">200 MCU credits/month</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-primary\">check_circle</span><span class=\"text-on-surface\">Basic AI agents</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-primary\">check_circle</span><span class=\"text-on-surface\">Community support</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-primary\">check_circle</span><span class=\"text-on-surface\">1 team member</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-primary\">check_circle</span><span class=\"text-on-surface\">API access</span></li></ul><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-medium rounded-full transition-colors bg-primary text-on-primary hover:bg-primary-hover px-8 py-4 text-lg h-14 w-full\">Start Free Trial</button></div><div class=\"relative p-8 rounded-2xl bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container shadow-xl md:scale-105\"><div class=\"absolute -top-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-inverse-primary text-on-inverse-primary text-sm font-bold px-4 py-1 rounded-full\">Most Popular</div><div class=\"text-center mb-6\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2 tracking-tight\">Growth</h3><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-center gap-1 mb-2\"><span class=\"text-4xl font-bold\">$149</span><span class=\"text-on-primary-container-variant\">/month</span></div><p class=\"text-on-primary-container-variant\">For growing teams and businesses</p></div><ul class=\"space-y-4 mb-8\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-primary\">check_circle</span><span class=\"text-on-primary-container\">1,000 MCU credits/month</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-primary\">check_circle</span><span class=\"text-on-primary-container\">Advanced AI agents</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-primary\">check_circle</span><span class=\"text-on-primary-container\">Priority support</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-primary\">check_circle</span><span class=\"text-on-primary-container\">5 team members</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-primary\">check_circle</span><span class=\"text-on-primary-container\">API access + Webhooks</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-primary\">check_circle</span><span class=\"text-on-primary-container\">Analytics dashboard</span></li></ul><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-medium rounded-full transition-colors bg-secondary text-on-secondary hover:bg-secondary-hover px-8 py-4 text-lg h-14 w-full\">Start Free Trial</button></div><div class=\"relative p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface text-on-surface \"><div class=\"text-center mb-6\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2 tracking-tight\">Premium</h3><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-center gap-1 mb-2\"><span class=\"text-4xl font-bold\">$499</span><span class=\"text-on-surface-variant\">/month</span></div><p class=\"text-on-surface-variant\">For enterprises with custom needs</p></div><ul class=\"space-y-4 mb-8\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-primary\">check_circle</span><span class=\"text-on-surface\">Unlimited MCU credits</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-primary\">check_circle</span><span class=\"text-on-surface\">Custom AI agents</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-primary\">check_circle</span><span class=\"text-on-surface\">24/7 dedicated support</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-primary\">check_circle</span><span class=\"text-on-surface\">Unlimited team members</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-primary\">check_circle</span><span class=\"text-on-surface\">Full API + Custom integrations</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-primary\">check_circle</span><span class=\"text-on-surface\">Advanced analytics</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-primary\">check_circle</span><span class=\"text-on-surface\">SLA guarantee</span></li></ul><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-medium rounded-full transition-colors bg-primary text-on-primary hover:bg-primary-hover px-8 py-4 text-lg h-14 w-full\">Contact Sales</button></div></div></div></section><!--